- all 11 files in `src/renderer/components/`
- `src/renderer/components/AGENTS.md` (new)
- `specs/prd.json`, `progress.log`

**Verification**

- `grep -rn "module\.exports\|require(" src/renderer/components/`
  returns no hits -- exit 1, the whole component layer is ESM.
- `npm test` (standard + depcheck) passes, exit 0.
- `npm run build` (Babel) compiles 64 files.
